Environment Variables
Farm data source (public Github Gist, no sensitive data)

Copy `.env.local.example` to `.env.local` and add your GitHub Gist URL.
VITE_GIST_URL=https://gist.githubusercontent.com/terriberri82/e3363ecd41ba7299e776c636a861e173/raw/b26742a11dda564e9f3b5e45ab70ec48105e265c/gambianFarms.txt

> Note: The Gist URL is publicly accessible and does not contain sensitive data. 
> It is stored as an environment variable to demonstrate best practices for 
> managing external URLs in a React application.